{"title": "Rebma", "pageid": 2080, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Placeholder\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Placeholder\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"300\">File:Placeholder</span></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Rebma</b> is an underwater city and reflection of <a href=\"/wiki/Amber\" title=\"Amber\">Amber</a>. Everything in Rebma is as it is in Amber, only reversed and underwater. <a href=\"/wiki/Llewella\" title=\"Llewella\">Llewella</a> made her home here and hardly departs. It is ruled by <a href=\"/wiki/Moire\" title=\"Moire\">Moire</a>, and home to a reflection of the Pattern. It is a rather crude pun; <i>Amber</i> spelled backwards.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260427235335\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofamber:pcache:idhash:2080-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260427235335 and revision id 4509. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "sections": [], "links": [{"ns": 0, "title": "Amber", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Llewella", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Moire", "exists": true}], "url": "https://amber.fandom.com/ru/wiki/Rebma"}